<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance edges up in January.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance edges up in January.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank rose slightly to 1.171 billion dinars at the end of January from 1.167 billion the previous month, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- rose to 2.498 billion dinars at the end of January from 2.494 billion at the end of December.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.836 billion in January 1996.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				 Jan '97		 Jan '96</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     146.6		    76.7</p>
<p>  New Issue		   150.0		    80.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,170.5		 2,026.4</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
